            "review_title": "Review at Got Pizza",
            "review_text": "Leanne N\n5 contributions\n0\nMouthwatering delicious and great hospitality\nMar 2026 • Couples\nPerfect 10/10\nFrom the moment we arrived on the scooter, the staff helped with the scooter. At the restaurant they opened the door for us. They spoke in English and were extremely friendly and polite. They didn't rush us to place our order. \nThe table was laiden with a beautiful folded napkin and clean cutlery. \nThe menu was extensive, but not too much. \nWhen the food arrived, it was delicious. We shared a pizza, Caesar salad and the Thai skewers. The portion sizes were spot on and the flavours from the food, mouth watering. \nWhat an absolutely great find. A definite must to try if you're in the area.\nRead more\nWritten March 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
