            "review_title": "Review at Got Pizza",
            "review_text": "fcplattner\nWalker, Minnesota120 contributions\n0\nPretty good meal but far too expensive\nFeb 2024 • Family\nWe arrived at restaurant and were seated right away. We ordered 2 pizzas and one order of seafood spaghetti for 3 adults and 2 children. The spaghetti and one pizza came quickly. The second pizza came well after we finished the first two entrees. In fact we were getting ready to leave when last pizza arrived. The restaurant was not busy. The taste of the spaghetti was just okay. I thought the two pizzas were good. The crust was good. I was shocked how high the price was. 1.2 million Dong for 2 medium pizza and a rather small serving of spaghetti. Even though the taste of the meal was good we will not come back again because they are so expensive\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2024",
