            "review_title": "Review at Got Pizza",
            "review_text": "Kelly\nChina59 contributions\n0\nThe dishes are delicious and beautifully presented\nJan 2023 • Couples\nGot Pizza has a very impressive green wall inside. Decor of the restaurant is luxurious. The security guard and the waiters are all friendly. Spacious parking lot, no fee.\n\nThe dishes are delicious and beautifully presented. Pizza can be ordered half-half to try many flavors to avoid boredom. \n\nNoodles and salads are also very good.It's worth experiencing :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 13, 2023",
